abstract: >
  CASCADE is a modular Python pipeline for analysing multi-electrode array (MEA)
  recordings from multiple manufacturers (3Brain, Maxwell Biosystems, Multi Channel
  Systems, Cortical Labs CL1, Axion BioSystems). It computes neuronal avalanches,
  criticality metrics (tau, alpha, DCC, branching ratio, shape collapse), functional
  connectivity, network bursts, and spatial entropy, producing publication-ready
  figures and machine-readable outputs.

keywords:
  - MEA
  - multi-electrode array
  - neuronal avalanches
  - criticality
  - electrophysiology
  - neuroscience
  - branching ratio
  - deviation from criticality coefficient
  - shape collapse error
  - Python
